{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>鑽進熱鬧的居酒屋，才是感受東京溫度的最佳方式。伴隨著冰凍生啤碰杯的清脆聲響、炭火串燒撲鼻的油脂焦香，身邊圍繞著在地上班族的暢快談笑，整天的奔波疲勞瞬間拋諸腦後。\n</p>\n<p>今次為大家精選10間澀谷Tabelog高分居酒屋，由後巷的昭和風炭火老舖、人氣鮮魚海鮮酒場，到新派時尚居酒屋統統有齊，今晚就跟著在地人乾一杯，好好享受東京微醺時光～</p>\n<p>🩵留言「cheers」Send澀谷精選居酒屋list &amp; 預約連結給你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318164297190965_2221613926ae1c7cc17419.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179318164297190965_2221613926ae1c7cc17419.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@tabelog_japanbylocals / 官方)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfCDsohkzgu/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%be%80%e8%b0%b7%e5%b1%85%e9%85%92%e5%b1%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">澀谷居酒屋</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%be%80%e8%b0%b7%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">澀谷美食</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%82%ba%e9%a3%9f%e6%a6%9c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">為食榜</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@tabelog_japanbylocals / 官方資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfCDsohkzgu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:3